OL,3,CStorm could cause flooding in Scotland
OL,4,Cwhile South East cries out for rain
OL,6,FThundery showers are set to batter
OL,7,Fparts of the country and a handful of
OL,8,Fflood alerts are in place in Scotland
OL,9,F` while central and southern England
OL,10,Fare likely to miss out on most of the
OL,11,Fmuch-needed rain.
OL,13,FTemperatures will cool towards
OL,14,Faverages for the time of year on
OL,15,FWednesday, the Met Office said, after
OL,16,Fa spike at the start of the week, and
OL,17,Fthere will also be a marked north-
OL,18,Fsouth split in conditions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
