OL,3,CStorm could cause flooding in Scotland
OL,4,Cwhile South East cries out for rain
OL,6,FWhile rain is forecast for northern
OL,7,FEngland, Northern Ireland, Wales and
OL,8,FScotland, there will be little to
OL,9,Fspeak of in other parts of England.
OL,11,FA yellow thunderstorm warning is in
OL,12,Fplace for eastern parts of Scotland
OL,13,Ffrom 10am to 9pm on Wednesday, with
OL,14,Fforecasters warning of a small chance
OL,15,Fof flooding, with potential for damage
OL,16,Fto buildings from floodwater,
OL,17,Flightning strikes or strong winds.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
