OL,3,CStorm could cause flooding in Scotland
OL,4,Cwhile South East cries out for rain
OL,6,FSeveral flood alerts have been issued
OL,7,Fby the Scottish Environment Protection
OL,8,FAgency, meaning flooding is possible
OL,9,Fand residents and business owners
OL,10,Fshould be prepared.
OL,12,FBy Thursday, outbreaks of rain in the
OL,13,Fnorth will sink south, but they will
OL,14,Fturn more showery, forecasters said.
OL,16,FSome of it may reach rain-starved
OL,17,Fparts of eastern England, though
OL,18,Flittle is expected for central and
OL,19,Fsouthern England.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
