OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785910693
OL,3,CStorm could cause flooding in Scotland
OL,4,Cwhile South East cries out for rain
OL,6,FJuly was the driest month ever
OL,7,Frecorded in southern England ` and
OL,8,Fmeteorologists have said there may not
OL,9,Fbe significant rainfall in the area
OL,10,Ffor some time.
OL,12,F"It's looking pretty dry (for southern
OL,13,FEngland)," said Met Office forecaster
OL,14,FMarco Petagna.
OL,16,F"Later on Sunday we could just get a
OL,17,Ffew showers coming down from the North
OL,18,FWest.
OL,20,F"But the rain's weakening as it comes
OL,21,Finto the South East."
