CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785910693
OL,3,CStorm could cause flooding in Scotland
OL,4,Cwhile South East cries out for rain
OL,6,FMr Petagna added: "Even for the second
OL,7,Fhalf of the month (August), it is
OL,8,Fsuggested that rainfall totals are
OL,9,Fmore likely to be below normal than
OL,10,Fabove, with a potential for further
OL,11,Fspells of hot weather at times as well.
OL,13,F"So nothing significant on the horizon
OL,14,Ffor the South East."
OL,16,FThe extreme weather of summer 2026 has
OL,17,Fincluded two record-breaking heatwaves
OL,18,Fin May and June that led to more than
OL,19,F2,800 excess deaths.
OL,26,@nD@SOUuD@AOUvD@TO]
