PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785910693
OL,3,CStorm could cause flooding in Scotland
OL,4,Cwhile South East cries out for rain
OL,6,FTwo more heatwaves in July, the driest
OL,7,FJuly in England and Wales since
OL,8,Frecords began, have fuelled drought
OL,9,Fand wildfires.
OL,11,FMajor supermarkets have removed
OL,12,Fdisposable barbecues from sale amid
OL,13,Fwarnings of a heightened risk of
OL,14,Fwildfires.
OL,16,FAsda was the latest to start pulling
OL,17,Fsingle-use grills from its shelves on
OL,18,FTuesday as a spell of exceptionally
OL,19,Fdry and hot weather continues to grip
OL,20,Fparts of the UK.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
